mended for adsorption/desorption measurements for ionisable substances. At this moment, there is no specific standard method available for Kd determination of metals. Care should be taken that soil, sediments and suspended solids characteristics are selected that are representative of the environmental conditions encountered in the region of interest (Example 2-5).\n\nE", "metadata": {"doc_id": "a1ea1161-683d-484f-881a-746c936d7419", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r7_13_2_en.pdf"}}